Team Reilly Group Rules:

•	Check the channel regularly so messages don’t get missed.
•	Use the channel for group-related topics and private chat for side conversations.
•	Be clear and respectful in messages; keep communication professional.
•	Respond within a reasonable time (for example, within 24 hours).
•	Share files in Team Reilly Group Chat, not in private chats, so everyone has access.
•	Give advance notice if you’ll be unavailable or late on a task.
•	Stick to agreed deadlines and communicate early if issues come up.
